      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-04-23T12:08:19.000Z",
      "title": "Price target increased by 7.4% to ₹1,463",
      "body": "Up from ₹1,363, the current price target is an average from 35 analysts. New target price is approximately in line with last closing price of ₹1,411. Stock is up 16% over the past year. The company is forecast to post earnings per share of ₹20.39 for next year compared to ₹18.15 last year.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
