      "id": "9c6efc1e-e131-4206-845d-a1d58ce2b2dc",
      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-04-21T08:44:00.000Z",
      "title": "Nestlé India Limited Recommends Final Dividend for the Financial Year 2025-26, Payable on and from 30 July 2026",
      "body": "Nestlé India Limited recommends final dividend of INR 5 per share for the financial year 2025-26 on the entire issued, subscribed and paid-up share capital of the Company of 1,928,314,320 equity shares of face value of INR 1 each. Fixed 10th July 2026 as Record Date for the purpose of determining entitlement of the members to the final dividend for the financial year 2025-26, if approved by the members at the ensuing 67th AGM, which shall be paid on and from 30th July 2026. Enclosed is the intimation of the Record Date. The Annual Report for the financial year 2025-26 and Notice of the 67th AGM shall be sent in due course.",
      "keyDevTypeId": "45",
