    {
      "id": "8f7ed94f-95c3-4c32-96ce-1b58098ed51a",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-02-02T11:55:38.000Z",
      "title": "Dividend of ₹7.00 announced",
      "body": "Shareholders will receive a dividend of ₹7.00. Ex-date: 6th February 2026 Payment date: 1st March 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.9%, which is about the same as the industry average. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is covered by earnings (79% earnings payout ratio) but not covered by cash flows (135% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 20% per year over the past 10 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. EPS is expected to grow by 45% over the next 3 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
      "id": "71737da7-860a-4c43-bd5e-eaca4122a6db",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-02-01T17:31:30.000Z",
      "title": "High number of new directors",
      "body": "There are 5 new directors who have joined the board in the last 3 years. Additional Non-Executive Director Mandeep Chhatwal was the last director to join the board, commencing their role in 2026. The company’s lack of board continuity is considered a risk according to the Simply Wall St Risk Model.",
